Package: libfontconfig-dev
Version: @DEB_FONTCONFIG_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Depends: libfreetype-dev, firmware (>= 14.0) | libexpat1-dev, libfontconfig1 (= @DEB_FONTCONFIG_V@)
Section: Development
Priority: standard
Description: generic font configuration library - development (Ladybird pin 2.17.1)
 Fontconfig is a font configuration and customization library, which does not
 depend on the X Window System.
 .
 This package contains the headers and pkg-config needed to build applications
 using fontconfig.
